<title>USA: AMEX listed 39 new companies in first half of 1997.</title>
<headline>AMEX listed 39 new companies in first half of 1997.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange said Wednesday it listed 39 new companies in the first half of this year, up from 34 new listings in the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>The exchange now lists a total of 752 companies. It said it hopes to list an additional 51 companies in the second half of this year.</p>
